 Node 20 and 22.\n\nExact-source native evidence covers Theme Standard/Large owned media draft rotation and a separate Large/Plain empty-picker rotation case. Plain owned-preview and Missions/Replay observations remain donor-specific. Public deployment, public rotation/native journeys, physical input, screen readers, zoom, offline/BFCache, audio and parent-phase acceptance remain separate. The recovered host’s stale failure copy remains a known follow-up.\n"}